<http://data.silknow.org/object/df83d011-0afa-3f12-b89b-8027b41ed8aa/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Pair of sleeve ruffles of cream silk striped gauze. Both are double layered and have 1 3/4 edging of bobbin lace. The bobbin lace has a pattern of cloth-stitched leaves and buds, outlined with a thicker silk cordonnet. The ground has marked horizontal lines, broken by square spots woven with the worker bobbins and decorated with picots."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/df83d011-0afa-3f12-b89b-8027b41ed8aa> .

